      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "`toonstandardDoubleSided` should not work, but may be misinterpreted due to a bug where \"Toon Standard (Outline)\" will not fall back correctly (the tag is not set on the SubShader, but the Pass declaration).\n\nUnlitDoubleSided is not supposed to work, and we will update the documentation accordingly.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
